<title>ITALY: CYCLING-UKRAINE'S GONTCHAR WINS 18TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-UKRAINE'S GONTCHAR WINS 18TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>CAVALESE, Italy 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serguei Gontchar of Ukraine won a 40-km time trial for the 18th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Wednesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Russian Eugeni Berzin was second and Italy's Bruno Boscardin third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy retained the overall lead.</p>
